// 0.3.0 pass 2: Arcade Mode = a virtual Grand Stick III (paprium_gs3) in port 1 and the EA 4-Way Play for 3-Player
// Mode, through paprium_pads in front of the console pad ports (Pocket core_top ~2034-2110). OSD -> pads mapping as
// Pocket core_top 700-737. Taken at boot: the values load only while sys_reset is high (Pocket gs3_md_sync takes them
// at reset too), so a menu change applies at the next Reset. With gs3_on = 0 and fourway = 0 the MiSTer md_io path is
// used unchanged (multitap, mouse, lightgun, J-Cart stay as before).
// (gs3/tap/stage regs declared above the cartridge instance, 'Arcade OSD' block)

// MiSTer joystick {Z,Y,X,Mode,Start,C,B,A,U,D,L,R} -> Pocket key word (paprium_pads: 0 U,1 D,2 L,3 R,4 C,5 B,6 Y,
// 7 A,8 X,9 Z,14 Mode/Select,15 Start; [31:28] type 2 = a pad that is there).
function [31:0] pkey(input [11:0] j);
	pkey = {4'd2, 12'd0, j[7], j[8], 4'd0, j[11], j[9], j[4], j[10], j[5], j[6], j[0], j[1], j[2], j[3]};
